1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:03,067
Ten dollars a day. Too small to matter?

2
00:00:03,367 --> 00:00:06,267
Same ten dollars. Two different choices.

3
00:00:06,567 --> 00:00:09,167
Spend it today, and enjoy the moment.

4
00:00:09,467 --> 00:00:14,900
Set it aside daily. That is three thousand, six hundred and fifty dollars a year.

5
00:00:15,200 --> 00:00:19,700
Keep going for ten years. Thirty-six thousand, five hundred dollars.

6
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:23,700
That is before interest, assuming you save every day.

7
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:29,400
You do not have to give up every little luxury. Just give some of those dollars a future.
